# Services
- Implement business logic here; keep functions pure where possible and testable.
- Validate inputs and handle errors; raise domain errors mapped by routes.
- Use parameterized queries/ORM-safe access via models; no raw SQL concatenation.
- Interact with external services (Stripe, Plaid, AWS) via dedicated clients.
